WEBVTT

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.690
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.540
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.750
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.550
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.150
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.570
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.750
The war which has
shaken all of Lodoss...

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:25.040
between Beld, the dark emperor
of Marmo, and King Fahn of Valis...

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:28.620
has ended with the
deaths of both leaders.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.330
In generations to come,
this battle will...

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:35.450
come to be known as
"The War of Heroes."

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:39.840
But few will know of the
mysterious, shadowy forces...

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.910
which were at work
behind the scenes.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.180
Is that for Leylia?

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.030
Yeah.

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:17.300
I'd expect something fancier
would be more appropriate.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:23.550
Hear me well.
This is for <i>Leylia</i>.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:28.560
The woman you've all
seen so far is only Karla!

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.660
Damn!
It really burns me up!

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:07.430
That mayor <i>begged</i> us
to protect his village!

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:12.240
Doesn't it just
piss you off?! Well?

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.360
Damn it to hell!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:28.220
The war ends, they boot us out
like we're the scum of the earth!

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:32.120
What the hell do they
think mercenaries are for?!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.330
Where are they from?

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.340
Dunno.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.930
One of 'em
looks like a merc.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.300
The other's a thief,
I think.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:49.810
And... an elf.

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:52.340
An elf? Marmo?

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.560
Maybe.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:58.360
Damn, they're headed straight for
that village we were protecting.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.280
That's not our problem.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.280
That's not the point!

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:09.180
Hoping to finally win
a true peace for the land...

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.790
Parn and his friends
race towards Karla's castle.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.550
Why, you...!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.810
Etoh! Wood!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.910
Orson!
Take care of them!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.190
Parn!

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.860
Marmo soldiers?

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.610
Who's a Marmo?!

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.670
Can't win without your
elf helping you, huh?!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.500
Deed! It's all right!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.920
I think we've just got
a misunderstanding here.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:08.430
A little violent for a
simple misunderstanding!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.170
Stop it!
We aren't Marmo!

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.170
You've got an elf with you!

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:17.470
For heaven's sake!

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:20.060
Can't you tell the difference
between me and a Dark Elf?!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.060
What?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:03.530
And how many priests
of Falis are on Marmo?

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.190
We're in a hurry.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.490
Sorry, but could you
just leave us alone?

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:18.790
Is he...?!

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.800
Drop your sword! Hurry!

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:22.940
What?

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.290
Hurry!

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:44.720
Parn!

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.900
Orson, stop it!
Calm down!

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.420
What's with this guy?!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.760
No one can stop Orson
once he gets mad!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.910
That's why I told you
to drop your sword!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.260
And you expected
me to just <i>do</i> it?!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.010
Parn!

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:21.770
Wait!
I think he's a berserker!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.670
Orson, stop it!

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.180
I'm all right!
The village is all right!

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:37.410
No one's going to be killed!
No one has to die!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.000
No!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.000
Don't kill him!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.670
I'm sorry we thought
you were Marmo.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.970
I'll help you any way I can,
just don't kill him!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.180
Orson's my friend!

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:14.290
Parn, we'd better go.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:17.000
We don't have time
for a berserker.

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.610
"Berserker?"

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:24.120
He's possessed by Hyuri,
the spirit of rage and madness.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.920
He's lost the fear of death.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:31.950
Yes.

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:36.410
It's said that where a berserker
passes, only corpses remain.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:56.480
Ghim!

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.990
Enough waiting!

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:03.490
But how do you plan to
release Leylia from Karla's hold?

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:08.480
Leylia will know me.
I know she will.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:14.960
Slayn, if you try to
cast a spell on me again...

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.390
Ghim!

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.040
Let me go alone!

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:15.040
I was so looking forward to this,
and only the dwarf shows.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.440
Karla! No.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.100
You are Leylia!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:33.180
Daughter of Neese,
priestess of Marfa!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.960
Remember, Leylia!

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:36.580
Did I not tell you?

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:42.030
Her consciousness exists
no longer. Only I remain.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.420
You cannot harm me.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.540
This is your beloved
Leylia's body.

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:10.060
Valiant, good dwarf.
But I am not so forgiving.

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:23.280
Parn!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.330
If you... want a body...

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.750
Then take... mine instead!

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:41.340
You think too
highly of yourself.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.150
Ghim!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:20.360
Karla! Why?!
Why did you kill Beld?

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:26.320
Oh? Would you have preferred
Beld to conquer all Lodoss?

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:27.390
What?!

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:32.830
Did you really think
I would give Lodoss to him?

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:36.680
"Give Lodoss...?"

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:41.030
Had Fahn survived, the outcome
would have been identical.

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:45.240
All was done to save
Lodoss from destruction.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:48.700
All so Lodoss
could survive evermore!

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:50.640
You lie!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:53.700
I love Lodoss with all my heart.

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.960
You think I'd believe you?!

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:03.750
Parn!

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:09.990
Wood!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.250
Slayn!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:41.330
PARN!

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.730
Look well.

00:15:58.730 --> 00:16:02.850
The destruction of Kastuul,
glorious Kingdom of Sorcery.

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.320
Kingdom of Sorcery...
Kastuul...?

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:11.270
Endless battles to recover
the power of total domination.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.810
Such is the torment of Lodoss.

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:19.920
The destruction of my homeland of
Kastuul left me with one lesson:

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:23.560
Power must never again be allowed
to consolidate in one place.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:27.340
As long as it
remains scattered...

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:30.100
the destruction will
never be complete.

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:36.860
And so I cause these wars.

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:42.770
Yes. For five centuries past
have I thus protected Lodoss.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:46.160
No. It can't be.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:57.490
It's still not too late.

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:09.500
Will you not guide
Lodoss with me?

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.740
Come.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:19.010
Throw off your old armor
and take up a new mantle to wear.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.110
I...

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:46.390
I don't believe you!

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:48.860
Someone who truly
protects Lodoss...

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:51.950
wouldn't do it by playing
with other people's lives!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:55.920
We aren't just
pawns for you to move!

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:06.180
Parn!

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:08.570
Are you all right?

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:15.070
Damn! She'll waste us before
we ever get that circlet off of her!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.700
Her circlet?

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:22.200
Yes, Wort said the circlet on
her forehead is Karla's true form.

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.550
Leylia.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:37.050
It would seem I misjudged you.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:43.060
I've no use for pawns
who refuse to be moved.

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:55.610
GHIM!

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:01.620
Ghim!

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.200
Wait! You'll be finished
if you go out there!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.620
But...!

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:30.770
Try to remember...!
Leylia!

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.270
What are you...?!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:39.300
Leylia!
You are... Leylia!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.210
God dammit,
can't we do <i>something</i>?!

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:16.060
Parn, now!

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:00.050
Leylia.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:03.500
Ghim?!

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:16.540
Ghim... Ghim!

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:18.540
GHIM!!!

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:07.850
Ghim won the victory
he sought.

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:11.150
He had no regrets, surely.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:12.790
Ghim.

00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:24.760
Wood.

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:34.540
There is no stopping
the flow of time.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.960
But no sooner does
one realize this...

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:42.040
than a new chapter
of history begins.

00:22:53.810 --> 00:22:57.500
The ambitions of the dark wizard
Wagnard begin to take action.

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.350
With great powers of
darkness urging him on...

00:22:59.720 --> 00:23:02.000
our victory is
by no means assured.

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:06.410
And now, as we move across Lodoss,
a new battle threatens to ignite!

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:09.200
Next time,
on Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:09.550 --> 00:23:12.700
Episode 9 -
"The Scepter of Domination"

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:16.540
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
